  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
